# Critical log tab flash (always)

Resume: `@critical-log-blink$` / `$critical-logs$`.

When a **critical** failure is recorded in a Master Admin log surface, the matching **subtab and parent group tab flash** (`.is-blink` / `criticalLogTabBlink`) until the operator acknowledges or clears the unread state. Same visual language as Security System Messages — do not invent one-off blink CSS per panel.

## Module

`floqr-critical-log-blink.js` → `window.FLOQRCriticalLogBlink`

```js
FLOQRCriticalLogBlink.set("geminiApiAccess", {
  tabId: "appLoggingTab",
  parentGroup: "diagnostics",
  label: "Application Logging",
  count: failureCount,
  newestMs
});
FLOQRCriticalLogBlink.ack("geminiApiAccess"); // session watermark
FLOQRCriticalLogBlink.clear("geminiApiAccess");
```

Parent group blink = **OR** of every registered source under that `data-group`.

## Registered sources (extend here)

| Source id | Tab | Parent | Critical when |
|---|---|---|---|
| `securitySystemMessages` | Security System Messages | `security` | Unread security inbox rows |
| `displayLoadErrors` | Display / Xibo Load Errors | `diagnostics` | New load-error events (seen watermark) |
| `geminiApiAccess` | Application Logging | `diagnostics` | `geminiApiAccessLogs` failures (`severity:"critical"`) |

## Gemini (example critical log)

- Writer: `functions/gemini-api-access-log.js` stamps `severity:"critical"` / `critical:true` on failures.
- Live watch + Acknowledge: `master-logging-extension.js`.
- Ack is sessionStorage (`floqr.criticalLogAck.geminiApiAccess`) — flash returns when a **newer** failure arrives.

## Checklist (new critical log)

- [ ] Stamp `severity: "critical"` (or equivalent) on the failure row
- [ ] Register via `FLOQRCriticalLogBlink.set` (not a one-off `.is-blink` toggle that fights the parent OR)
- [ ] Provide clear/ack path (mark-read, seen watermark, or Acknowledge button)
- [ ] Load `floqr-critical-log-blink.js` before the panel script on Master Admin
- [ ] Update `docs/FEATURE-WIRING.md` + diagnostics Manual Feature Test
